{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Geringi?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GERINGI is a solo developed stylized open world survival horror game where you explore a post apocalyptic world that has been invaded by creatures that have arrived with a mysterious fog from another realm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story revolves around David, a survivor of the apocalypse, and Wes, a mysterious young boy who lost his legs in an attack before David met him and took him in. Together, they embark on a road trip to Blackridge, a rumored safe haven where the remaining survivors can live in peace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can explore the first map, Ashford Island, and experience the first 3 days of this story, as well as side missions that will grant you new weapons and upgrades. You can meet mysterious strangers, save people in need, and speak to voices beyond the physical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u223c2 hours of demo gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camps to raid and loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cover art by Ezgi Candemir</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594710?t=1743708965","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594710?t=1743708965","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594710/8c9667b05fb328481aa443bbb1cf6f932dd78e3e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743708965","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594710/8c9667b05fb328481aa443bbb1cf6f932dd78e3e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743708965","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What is Geringi?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">GERINGI is a solo developed stylized open world survival horror game where you explore a post apocalyptic world that has been invaded by creatures that have arrived with a mysterious fog from another realm.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story revolves around David, a survivor of the apocalypse, and Wes, a mysterious young boy who lost his legs in an attack before David met him and took him in. Together, they embark on a road trip to Blackridge, a rumored safe haven where the remaining survivors can live in peace.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you can explore the first map, Ashford Island, and experience the first 3 days of this story, as well as side missions that will grant you new weapons and upgrades. You can meet mysterious strangers, save people in need, and speak to voices beyond the physical world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized open world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u223c2 hours of demo gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Camps to raid and loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cover art by Ezgi Candemir</p></li></ul>","developers":["Deniz Works"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3567120","name":"GERINGI"},"genres":[{"description":"A